<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0673_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Torin</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m finna practice a WHOLE bunch so we\ncan scrap again next time.\rGimme your number so I can call you!\fI’ll call after homework. Maybe. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, you saved!\nLater! I got a quiz tomorrow.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s too bad...\nI’m tellin’ my teacher.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! You REALLY wanna swap numbers\nwith me, don’t you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh?\nI can hear a windmill...\rThat mean you nearby, ain’t you?\nCome talk for real! Recess is short!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} go HARD!\rEverything I learn at school, it\nrepeat it right away.\fIncludin’ the bad words. Mom’s mad.\rYour homies listen to what you say?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yesterday we scrapped a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}!\rWe practiced all the stuff I learned\nin school!\rWhere you go to school?\nYou don’t go to MY school?\fThere’s other schools?!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was tryna catch a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, but it\ndipped! SO disappointin’!\rSo I don’t forget, I write the name of\nevery homie that got away in my\fnotebook.\rThere’s homie names ALL over my\nnotebook! My math notes is GONE.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, come scrap me again.\nI’ll be waitin’ at {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!\fAfter school. I mean it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup? I’m at {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. We was finna\nscrap, wasn’t we?\fHurry up! Bedtime is 8!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0673_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? The only time you see me is when\nI’m walkin’ HOME from school?\rWhen I’m walkin’ TO school, I’m always\nrushin’ so I ain’t late.\rI ain’t got time for scraps then!\fI’m late anyway. Every day.</language>
	</row>
</body>
